# The bare `lib/` above is a Python-packaging artifact pattern; it must NOT swallow
# the frontend source dir voter-app/src/lib/ (shadcn `cn` helper). Without this the
# file was untracked → absent on CI → every `@/lib/utils` import failed under coverage.
!voter-app/src/lib/
!voter-app/src/lib/**
