# ── Auto-generated API artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# (kept committed for now so contributors don't need a backend running)
# fast_api_voter/openapi.gen.json   ← tracked, regenerated by scripts/gen_openapi.py
# voter-app/src/api/types.gen.ts     ← tracked, regenerated by `npm run gen:api`

# ── Agent tooling — project config (settings.json, skills/, agents/,
# commands/) is tracked so it reaches every worktree/branch like any other
# repo file; settings.local.json, worktrees/ and scheduled_tasks.lock are
# per-machine/per-session state (local permission grants tied to one temp
# session dir, the local worktree registry, a lock file) and stay untracked.
# The journal-writer agent and /log-session command feed docs/journal/
# (tracked below) — keeping the tool out of the repo while its output is in
# it made no sense ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
# .vscode/ already ignored above

# Synced Claude Code session/memory data from another machine (Windows path
# C:\Users\burba\Vote-App), landed inside the repo root via OneDrive sync.
/c--Users-burba-Vote-App/

# ── graphify knowledge-graph (regeneratable via `graphify update .`) ─────────
graphify-out/
.graphifyignore

# ── Process / planning / design docs (kept local, not in the repo) ──────────
# App stays: README*, THEORY.md, GUIDE_UTILISATEUR.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, research/, .github/
# NOTE: excludes docs/ CONTENTS (/docs/*), not the directory itself — git cannot
# re-include anything under a directory that is itself excluded, so `/docs/` would
# make the `!` negation below silently inert.
/docs/*
# Architecture Decision Records are versioned on purpose: an ADR that only exists
# on one machine cannot do its job (record a structural decision for everyone, in
# history). Same failure mode as the untracked-source bug ci-local/run-ci.sh's own
# preflight guard exists to catch — that guard only scopes to source extensions
# under voter-app/src and fast_api_voter/api, so it would not have caught this.
!/docs/adr/
# Le journal de bord est versionné pour la même raison, et elle s'est vérifiée :
# il documente désormais plusieurs jours d'investigation dense (chaîne causale
# seed=42, chantier de distribution, ADR-002) dont le raisonnement n'existe
# nulle part ailleurs — les commits portent le résultat, le journal porte le
# pourquoi. Le garder hors du dépôt le laissait sur un seul disque, exactement
# le risque évité pour le correctif de prompt et les commits de distribution.
!/docs/journal/
/AGENTS.md
/STRATEGIC_REFACTOR_PLAN.md
/CODE_AUDIT_CHECKLIST.md
/PRE_PUBLIC_CHECKLIST.md
/PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md
/PLAN.md
/PLAN_A_VOUS_DE_JOUER.md
/PLAN_UX_ACCESSIBILITE.md
/PLAN_METHODES_HISTOIRES_ATLAS.md
/DEMARRAGE-polity-v0.md
/polity-simulation-design-v2.md
/dev-plan-v0-worktree.md
/audit-precision-plan.md
/prompt-liquid-democracy-conviction-voting.md
# Scratch file used to hand a prompt to the coding agent, rewritten between
# turns — session input, never a project artefact.
/prompt.txt
/files/

